WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.207 --> 00:00:02.708
(Viserys): The Battle of the Trident

00:00:02.709 --> 00:00:06.211
may have been an important victory
for the Usurper,

00:00:06.212 --> 00:00:09.882
but it was the treachery
and barbarism of Tywin Lannister

00:00:09.883 --> 00:00:13.552
that sealed the fate
of the Targaryen dynasty.

00:00:13.553 --> 00:00:15.179
My father, King Aerys,

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:18.682
had ever been a friend
to the Lions of the Rock.

00:00:18.683 --> 00:00:22.853
Aerys graciously brought Tywin to court,

00:00:22.854 --> 00:00:27.316
making him the youngest
Hand of the King in history.

00:00:27.317 --> 00:00:29.151
He gave him power.

00:00:29.152 --> 00:00:30.986
He gave him respect.

00:00:30.987 --> 00:00:35.987
He made it possible for Tywin
to restore House Lannister to glory.

00:00:35.992 --> 00:00:40.992
Aerys and Tywin governed side by side
for 20 prosperous years.

00:00:42.415 --> 00:00:45.876
Still, when the Usurper
called his banners in rebellion,

00:00:45.877 --> 00:00:49.505
Tywin Lannister
ignored his king's pleas for help,

00:00:49.506 --> 00:00:54.343
and stayed holed up
in his stronghold of Casterly Rock.

00:00:54.344 --> 00:00:58.263
In time, my brother Prince Rhaegar
was dead.

00:00:58.264 --> 00:01:00.432
The realm was in turmoil...

00:01:00.433 --> 00:01:05.433
and the Usurper's forces were
said to be riding for King's Landing.

00:01:05.605 --> 00:01:07.814
What a glorious sight it must have been

00:01:07.815 --> 00:01:10.943
when a force of 10,000 Lannister men

00:01:10.944 --> 00:01:13.278
showed up at the gate of the capital

00:01:13.279 --> 00:01:15.656
with Lord Tywin at their head,

00:01:15.657 --> 00:01:19.034
pledging support to his beleaguered king.

00:01:19.035 --> 00:01:23.288
Aerys opened the gates for his old friend.

00:01:23.289 --> 00:01:25.958
Instead, Lannister and his men

00:01:25.959 --> 00:01:28.252
proceeded to plunder and destroy

00:01:28.253 --> 00:01:32.798
the city that he had called home
for decades.

00:01:32.799 --> 00:01:34.424
As the capital was ravaged

00:01:34.425 --> 00:01:36.969
and its people terrorized,

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:39.596
Jaime Lannister, son of Lord Tywin,

00:01:39.597 --> 00:01:42.683
proved every bit as treacherous.

00:01:42.684 --> 00:01:47.646
He killed my father, the king,
at the foot of the Iron Throne.

00:01:47.647 --> 00:01:49.565
The Lannisters entered the Red Keep

00:01:49.566 --> 00:01:54.236
and Tywin ordered the deaths
of the rest of the royal family.

00:01:54.237 --> 00:01:58.490
It is said Princess Rhaenys was found
cowering under her father's bed

00:01:58.491 --> 00:02:00.909
and put to the sword.

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:03.495
She was only a child.

00:02:03.496 --> 00:02:05.914
As for Rhaegar's widow, Elia,

00:02:05.915 --> 00:02:07.416
she was forced to watch

00:02:07.417 --> 00:02:12.004
as Lannister thugs dashed
her baby son's head against a wall,

00:02:12.005 --> 00:02:16.383
before being raped and murdered herself.

00:02:16.384 --> 00:02:18.677
As I was the heir to my father's throne,

00:02:18.678 --> 00:02:21.013
I had been spirited away to Dragonstone

00:02:21.014 --> 00:02:24.683
with my mother, Queen Rhaella,
who was with child.

00:02:24.684 --> 00:02:27.978
As a raging summer storm
battered the island fortress

00:02:27.979 --> 00:02:31.940
and destroyed the Targaryen fleet
as it lay at anchor,

00:02:31.941 --> 00:02:35.193
my sister Daenerys was born.

00:02:35.194 --> 00:02:38.697
My mother, the queen, died giving birth.

00:02:38.698 --> 00:02:41.617
Now, some 17 years later,

00:02:41.618 --> 00:02:46.618
the rightful king still lives in exile.

00:02:46.664 --> 00:02:49.458
But a day of reckoning is coming.

00:02:49.459 --> 00:02:53.920
I will sail west,
as Aegon the Dragon did centuries before.

00:02:53.921 --> 00:02:58.759
I will take back my father's throne
with blood and fire.

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:03.555
And I will punish the treacherous dogs
who sought to destroy my family.

00:03:03.556 --> 00:03:08.556
And the people shall rejoice.

